{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011ChPofdsM5rizj1L9kYnMj","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I added the `Snapshot` model in a new `internal/snapshot` package, plus the pool and controller data it reads. `go test ./...` and `go test -race ./internal/snapshot` pass. `go vet` is clean for the packages I changed, but I didn't see `make lint` finish. Its `gofmt -l .` step fails on a parse error in `internal/roles/testdata/docs/skips/src/_x.go`, a file this change doesn't touch.\n\nThings that differ from the plan:\n- **Issue state:** I couldn't read open `ard:` labels without GitHub, so issues come from state only: running jobs plus jobs ended since 00:00 UTC. An issue's state is its latest job's stage, role and status.\n- **Cost cache:** it keys on the issue's job ids and update times, so close-out code is untouched. Issues with a running job are never cached. There is also a `Taker.Invalidate(issue)` that nothing calls yet.\n- **GitHub import:** the import test confirms `internal/snapshot` doesn't import `internal/github` directly. It imports `controller`, which does for its pause gate.\n- **Log tee:** it is wired into `ard serve` with no redact function, so the recorded copy is as unredacted as stderr already is. The optional redact hook is there if you want one.\n- **Parent issue:** I didn't have #407, so the field names follow #413's text.\n\n- **Pool:** it now reports recent `limited` and `budget` refusals per role and slot demand per role, and has a `HeldSlots()` accessor. Grant decisions are unchanged; a test checks that a limited candidate reserves no slot.\n- **Controller:** it records each claiming loop's last kill-switch result and each loop's last tick. A test confirms reading them never calls the pause gate.\n- **Wiring:** `ard serve` wraps its logger with the log tee and builds the snapshot taker (`internal/servecmd/snapshot.go`). Nothing renders it yet, so serve output is unchanged.\n- **Zero-GitHub test:** it takes three snapshots through a real controller and pause gate and asserts no `GetIssue` calls or writes.\n- **Docs:** `docs/layout.md` has the new package line and a pool note.\n\nThe report is at `.ard/413/worker-engineer.md`."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1136,"cache_read_input_tokens":95762,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1136},"output_tokens":736,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"57b1ced3-9a2b-47af-bdf0-bb815e19770b","uuid":"c195827a-f174-4921-bd76-3de87ef6624f","timestamp":"2026-11-25T14:29:28.001Z","request_id":"req_011ChPofdhvt5z4TSUcmQc29"}
